---
layout: base.njk
title: Schedule — CHIRP Radio
description: CHIRP Radio DJ schedule, organized by day of the week.
permalink: /schedule/
---

<h1>Schedule</h1>
<p>CHIRP DJs and their weekly time slots, Chicago time. Each day starts at midnight.</p>

{% for day in schedule.days %}
  {% set slots = schedule.grid[day] %}
  {% if slots.length %}
    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">{{ day | capitalize }}</h2>
    <table class="playlist" aria-label="{{ day | capitalize }} schedule">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Time</th>
          <th scope="col">DJ</th>
          <th scope="col">Show</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for slot in slots %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ slot.startTime | to12Hour }}–{{ slot.endTime | to12Hour }}</td>
          <td><a href="/djs/{{ slot.djSlug }}/">{{ slot.djName }}</a></td>
          <td>{{ slot.showName }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<p style="margin-top: 32px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.875rem;">
  Times shown in Chicago / Central time.
</p>
